(42, 'Zachary Thomas', 'Full-Stack Developer', 'Helped develop the \"Industrial Walkthrough Checklist & Guide\" application.\nOregon State University alumnus.', '/uploads/user_42/90e4705e29c3c10fdafad6cb5012ee0b.png', 10, 1),
