(73, 'Quan Nguyen', 'Student Software Developer', 'Senior student, majored in Computer Science with Web Development focus, expected to graduate in June 2021. Maintains and develops new features for \"Industrial Walkthrough Checklist & Guide\" web application.', '/uploads/user_73/7ac5d5bc4e55fc0607f70af142f41e2c.jpg', 10, 1),
