(75, 'Jett Seale', 'Student Software Developer', 'Senior Computer Science student with applied option in web and mobile application development. Maintains and develops new features for the \"Industrial Walkthrough Checklist & Guide\" application. ', '/uploads/user_75/61c7a72432a5959c2f9e77afc3888628.jpg', 10, 1),
