(2376, 264, 21687, 272, 0, 1, 4, '<p>Suitable only for larger systems with multiple evaporators. In order to use hot gas, the system needs to produce it. While one evaporator is defrosting the others will run; at least two to three evaporators running for each evaporator defrosting is required for low-moderate temperature systems.</p>', '', '', 0, 1, 0, 0, '2021-05-26 20:27:35'),
