(17261, 108, 0, 0, 3, '1 HP = 0.746 kW', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2021-03-18 18:20:28', 1, '', ''),
(17262, 108, 0, 0, 3, '<p>Cost to operate a motor at 75% load for a full year = $60/HP (Assumes $0.05/kWh, motor runs 8 hours a day, five days a week, 50 weeks a year)</p>', '', '', 0, 1, 0, 0, '2021-03-18 18:20:28', 1, '', ''),
(17263, 108, 0, 0, 3, '<p>Estimate 1.2 full-load amps per horsepower for motors on nominal 460 volt systems (2.4 full-load amps per horsepower on 230 volt systems)</p>', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2021-03-18 18:20:28', 1, '', ''),
(17325, 262, 0, 0, 2, '<p>Heat exchangers are highly customized systems, often requiring non-generic quotes and high costs. Physical space is a factor to conside,</p>', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2021-03-18 23:17:38', 1, '', ''),
(17326, 262, 0, 0, 2, 'Complex surface geometries can be difficult to insulate and require more custom solutions.', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2021-03-18 23:17:38', 1, '', ''),
(17327, 262, 0, 0, 2, 'Some fuel types produce combustion gasses that may not be compatible with all heat exchangers, requiring higher cost specialty equipment.', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2021-03-18 23:17:38', 1, '', ''),
(17328, 262, 0, 0, 2, '<p>Heat exchangers may become fouled in some applications, requiring maintenance costs for cleaning. </p>', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2021-03-18 23:17:38', 1, '', ''),
(17331, 264, 0, 0, 3, 'Rules of Thumb', '', '', 0, 1, 0, 0, '2021-03-18 23:22:21', 0, '', ''),
(17332, 301, 0, 0, 8, '<p>Use a thermal imaging camera or infrared thermometer to check for hot spots in insulation.</p>', '', '', 0, 1, 0, 0, '2021-03-18 23:22:31', 0, '', ''),
(17872, 129, 0, 0, 11, '<p>Install a Heat Exchanger Between Two Fluid Flows</p>', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2021-03-18 23:42:14', 1, '', ''),
(17873, 129, 0, 1, 31, '<p>The benefits of a heat exchanger between hot and cold streams can be twofold, such as hot milk coming out of pasteurization for cooling being used to preheat incoming milk. Less energy is required now to cool the pasteurized milk and the raw milk requires less heat to be added for pasteurization.</p>', '%zXz%', '%zXz%', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2021-03-18 23:42:14', 1, '', ''),
(17874, 129, 0, 1, 10, '<p>Two liquid, gas, or air flows with a large temperature difference where at least one stream requires heat treatment.</p>', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2021-03-18 23:42:14', 1, '', ''),
(17875, 129, 0, 1, 7, '<p>Heat exchangers are typically most effective when configured for counter-flow heat transfer</p>', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2021-03-18 23:42:14', 1, '', ''),
(17876, 129, 0, 1, 8, 'The higher the temperature difference between the fluid streams, the more heat can be exchanged', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2021-03-18 23:42:14', 1, '', ''),
(17877, 129, 0, 1, 14, 'How much can the temperature of the two fluid streams change without negatively affecting the process the fluids are required for?', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2021-03-18 23:42:14', 1, '', ''),
(17878, 129, 0, 1, 14, 'Can these streams be reasonably close together physically to fit into a heat exchanger?', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2021-03-18 23:42:14', 1, '', ''),
(17879, 129, 0, 1, 14, 'Is there space in the room to accomodate a heat exchanger?', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2021-03-18 23:42:14', 1, '', ''),
(17880, 129, 0, 1, 14, 'What kind of heat exchanger best fits the fluid stream? There are several different types.', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2021-03-18 23:42:14', 1, '', ''),
(17881, 129, 0, 1, 14, 'Is the fluid stream clean or dirty?', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2021-03-18 23:42:14', 1, '', ''),
(17882, 129, 0, 1, 15, 'System operation hours', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2021-03-18 23:42:14', 1, '', ''),
(17883, 129, 0, 1, 15, 'Fluid properties', '', '', 0, 0, 1, 0, '2021-03-18 23:42:14', 1, '', '');
