(22150, 100, 0, 0, 24, 'Engineering Toolbox, Complete steam tables with options for converting units', 'https://www.engineeringtoolbox.com/saturated-steam-properties-d_273.html', 'Steam Table', 1, 0, 0, 0, '2021-05-26 22:49:30', 1, '', ''),
(22151, 100, 0, 0, 24, 'TLV Steam Theory site. Contains several pages that explain steam systems and equations.', 'https://www.tlv.com/global/US/steam-theory/how-to-read-a-steam-table.html', 'TLV Steam Theory\nHow to read a Steam Table', 1, 0, 0, 0, '2021-05-26 22:49:30', 1, '', ''),
(22152, 100, 0, 0, 23, '<p>Steam boilers are specialized, mechanical devices designed to generate pressurized steam; an essential raw material used for industrial and commercial applications. But how does a steam boiler system work?</p>', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iY8iufFgxO4', 'How Do Steam Boilers Work\n', 1, 0, 0, 0, '2021-05-26 22:49:30', 1, '', ''),
(22153, 100, 0, 0, 23, '<p>This Video is about Boilers Basic Principles &amp; Types.</p><p></p><p></p>', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nxvav0Ijd4E', 'Boilers Basic Principles & Types | Piping Analysis', 1, 0, 0, 0, '2021-05-26 22:49:30', 1, '', ''),
(22154, 341, 0, 0, 17, '<p>U.S.DOE Better Buildings Webinar. This session discussed the basics of industrial energy and a systematic approach to improve its efficiency.</p>', 'https://betterbuildingssolutioncenter.energy.gov/webinars/basics-energy', 'Basics of industrial energy ', 3, 0, 0, 0, '2021-05-26 22:54:13', 0, '', ''),
(22155, 341, 0, 0, 17, '<p>U.S.DOE Better Buildings Webinar: Lighting systems, building envelope, and HVAC systems are very important for safety and productivity in manufacturing facilities. This session covered various lighting technologies (CFL, HID, LED, etc.) and lighting system control strategies (occupancy censors, light level sensors, etc.).</p>', 'https://betterbuildingssolutioncenter.energy.gov/webinars/lighting-hvac-and-building-envelope', 'Lighting systems, building envelope, and HVAC', 3, 0, 0, 0, '2021-05-26 22:54:13', 0, '', ''),
(22156, 341, 0, 0, 17, '<p>U.S.DOE Better Buildings Webinar: Compressed air systems consume around 90 billion kWh electricity in US each year. With almost 80% of this input electricity being dissipated as heat, compressed air is a very expensive utility. This session discussed the pros and cons of different compressor configurations, its controls with examples from the field and common energy conservation measures. </p>', 'https://betterbuildingssolutioncenter.energy.gov/webinars/compressed-air-systems', 'Compressed air systems', 3, 0, 0, 0, '2026-04-17 21:09:35', 0, '', ''),
(22157, 341, 0, 0, 17, '<p>U.S.DOE Better Buildings Webinar: Water efficiency. This webinar also highlighted the concept behind the Plant Water Profiler (PWP) tool and its functionality through pilot water In-Plant Trainings delivered in three manufacturing facilities in the U.S. </p>', 'https://betterbuildingssolutioncenter.energy.gov/webinars/water-efficiency', 'Water efficiency', 3, 0, 0, 0, '2021-05-26 22:54:13', 0, '', ''),
(22158, 341, 0, 0, 17, '<p>U.S.DOE Better Buildings Webinar: Presents the basics and fundamentals on understanding how these systems operate and more importantly, how to ensure they are optimized and operating efficiently.  </p>', 'https://betterbuildingssolutioncenter.energy.gov/webinars/better-plants-online-learning-series-webinar-8-pumps-and-fans', 'Pump and fan systems', 3, 0, 0, 0, '2021-05-26 22:54:13', 0, '', ''),
(22159, 341, 0, 0, 17, '<p>U.S.DOE Better Buildings Webinar: This webinar introduces process heating and energy-saving measures for industrial process heating equipment such as furnaces, dryers, ovens, heaters and kilns. </p>', 'https://betterbuildingssolutioncenter.energy.gov/webinars/better-plants-online-learning-series-webinar-9-process-heating-and-waste-heat-recovery', 'Process Heating and Waste Heat Recovery', 3, 0, 0, 0, '2021-05-26 22:54:13', 0, '', ''),
(22160, 341, 0, 0, 17, '<p>U.S.DOE Better Buildings Webinar: The MEASUR software is a technology- and vendor-agnostic software tool suite that allows you to quickly calculate the energy savings for a wide variety of opportunities found in your facility.</p>', 'https://betterbuildingssolutioncenter.energy.gov/webinars/better-plants-online-learning-series-webinar-11-using-measur-tool-suite', 'Using the MEASUR Tool Suite', 3, 0, 0, 0, '2021-05-26 22:54:13', 0, '', ''),
(22161, 341, 0, 0, 17, '<p>U.S.DOE Better Buildings Webinar: Chillers and cooling tower systems are necessary for keeping our products, equipment and staff cool throughout the year. This session provided an overview of these systems and covered the various technologies, control strategies and opportunities to optimize your process cooling systems.</p>', 'https://betterbuildingssolutioncenter.energy.gov/webinars/better-plants-online-learning-series-webinar-12-process-cooling', 'Process Cooling', 3, 0, 0, 0, '2021-05-26 22:54:13', 0, '', ''),
(22162, 341, 0, 0, 17, '<p>U.S.DOE Better Buildings Webinar Listing</p>', 'https://betterbuildingssolutioncenter.energy.gov/better-plants/online-learning-series', ' Better Plants Online Learning Series ', 1, 0, 0, 0, '2021-05-26 22:54:13', 0, '', ''),
