(22201, 343, 0, 1, 31, '<p>(You can find the card number by opening [Review Card] for the card of interest. Its number will be listed at the top left of the card. )</p>', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2021-05-26 23:22:17', 0, '', ''),
