(22204, 76, 0, 0, 17, 'MEASUR is open source software that consists of the following DOE legacy energy system assessment tools (updated): Pumping System Assessment Tool (PSAT), Process Heating Assessment and Survey Tool (PHAST), Fan System Assessment Tool (FSAT), Steam System Assessment Tool (SSAT)/ Steam System Modeler (SSMT), AIRMaster+ (Last accessed 12/2/2019)   ', 'https://www.energy.gov/eere/amo/measur', 'U.S. Department of Energy MEASUR analysis tool', 1, 0, 0, 0, '2021-05-26 23:27:42', 1, '', ''),
