(23821, 157, 0, 0, 26, '<p>Develop a table of significant energy using equipment including collected rated capacity, estimated % of full capacity, and hours of operation</p>', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-04-21 00:41:19', 1, '', ''),
(23822, 157, 1, 1, 12, '<p>Calculate an initial estimate of annual energy used by each piece of equipment</p>', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-04-21 00:41:19', 1, '', ''),
(23823, 157, 2, 1, 12, '<p>Develop a pie chart showing % of total site energy each modeled equipment item uses, and remaining unidentified energy use.</p>', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-04-21 00:41:19', 1, '', ''),
(23824, 157, 3, 2, 14, '<p>Does the total modeled energy exceed the actual energy in the bills? (If so, revise the model.) </p>', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-04-21 00:41:19', 1, '', ''),
(23825, 157, 4, 1, 12, '<p>Plan to continually revise and improve this balance over the process of the remote assessment.</p>', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-04-21 00:41:19', 1, '', ''),
(23826, 157, 5, 2, 14, '<p>Does more equipment come up that can be added?</p>', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-04-21 00:41:19', 1, '', ''),
(23827, 157, 6, 2, 14, '<p>Does better data become available on any modeled equipment to improve its annual energy use estimate?</p>', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-04-21 00:41:19', 1, '', ''),
(23828, 157, 7, 1, 17, '<p>(Item not added yet)</p>', 'osu.edu', 'Example Energy Balance', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-04-21 00:41:19', 1, '', ''),
(23829, 157, 8, 1, 32, '', 'https://www.ocpower.org/wp-content/uploads/Blog-EnergyEfficiencyDay-Main.jpg', '<p><br></p><p> </p><p> </p><p>  </p><p> </p><p>  </p><p>  </p><p>    </p>', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-04-21 00:41:19', 1, '', 'sha384-wjoALjPASV7UtSUpp//jvp4SDRCAZLIKWaVK7fnxETAEcvTdGvulJx4JyEUUxJpw'),
(23851, 243, 0, 0, 31, '<p>Once the report has been compiled and made it through the review process, a meeting with the client will be scheduled to present the findings and recommendations in the report.</p>', '%zXz%', '%zXz%', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-04-21 00:57:25', 0, '', ''),
(23852, 243, 1, 1, 31, '<p>This is something that we may start doing for all assessments moving forward.</p>', '%zXz%', '%zXz%', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-04-21 00:57:25', 0, '', ''),
(23853, 243, 2, 1, 31, '<p>If possible, this meeting should include all analysts involved in the report.</p>', '%zXz%', '%zXz%', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-04-21 00:57:25', 0, '', ''),
(23854, 243, 3, 1, 32, '', 'https://www.ocpower.org/wp-content/uploads/Blog-EnergyEfficiencyDay-Main.jpg', '<p><br></p>', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-04-21 00:57:25', 0, '', 'sha384-wjoALjPASV7UtSUpp//jvp4SDRCAZLIKWaVK7fnxETAEcvTdGvulJx4JyEUUxJpw'),
(23909, 158, 0, 0, 26, '<p>Review any areas of concern or interest voiced by the client</p>', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-04-21 00:59:31', 1, '', ''),
(23910, 158, 1, 0, 26, '<p>Review typical opportunities found in the energy intensive systems identified at the facility </p>', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-04-21 00:59:31', 1, '', ''),
(23911, 158, 2, 1, 8, '<p>This Industrial Walkthrough Checklist &amp; Reference will offer more and more ideas for potential opportunities as it is developed over time</p>', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-04-21 00:59:31', 1, '', ''),
(23912, 158, 3, 0, 26, '<p>Review the list of typical opportunities found in the site\'s industrial sector developed in Preliminary Research</p>', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-04-21 00:59:31', 1, '', ''),
(23913, 158, 4, 0, 26, '<p>Pick the brain of anyone with experience in the subject</p>', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-04-21 00:59:31', 1, '', ''),
(23914, 158, 5, 0, 26, '<p>Brainstorm on opportunities as a team and compile a list</p>', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-04-21 00:59:31', 1, '', ''),
(23915, 158, 6, 0, 26, '<p>Develop a table of potential recommendations, and if possible: total energy used by the system related to each opportunity, a high/low estimate of potential % savings,  and the range of potential cost and energy savings potential.</p>', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-04-21 00:59:31', 1, '', ''),
(23916, 158, 7, 0, 32, '', 'https://www.ocpower.org/wp-content/uploads/Blog-EnergyEfficiencyDay-Main.jpg', '<p>sdfgsdf</p>', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-04-21 00:59:31', 1, '', 'sha384-wjoALjPASV7UtSUpp//jvp4SDRCAZLIKWaVK7fnxETAEcvTdGvulJx4JyEUUxJpw'),
(24045, 383, 0, 0, 2, '<p> asdfasdfasdf</p><p>sdfsdfsdf</p><p> </p><p>  </p><p>  </p><p>    </p>', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-04-21 01:34:14', 0, '', ''),
(24046, 383, 1, 0, 32, '', 'https://www.ocpower.org/wp-content/uploads/Blog-EnergyEfficiencyDay-Main.jpg', '<p><br></p>', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-04-21 01:34:14', 0, '', 'sha384-wjoALjPASV7UtSUpp//jvp4SDRCAZLIKWaVK7fnxETAEcvTdGvulJx4JyEUUxJpw'),
(24074, 162, 0, 0, 31, '<p>This is a requirement for U.S.DOE to accept our remote assessment as a deliverable on our contract. It might be done in one session or iteratively in multiple sessions.</p>', '%zXz%', '%zXz%', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-04-21 02:02:23', 0, '', ''),
(24075, 162, 1, 0, 26, '<p>Begin with a review of preparatory work including the intitial energy balance, and list of possible opportunities.</p>', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-04-21 02:02:23', 0, '', ''),
(24076, 162, 2, 0, 26, '<p>Discuss the best strategy to use for a Guided Remote Tour. This might be: </p>', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-04-21 02:02:23', 0, '', ''),
(24077, 162, 3, 1, 12, '<p>A standard tour of the process from start to finish, but this could be an overly long time for a Zoom meeting. </p>', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-04-21 02:02:23', 0, '', ''),
(24078, 162, 4, 1, 12, '<p>A series of shorter remote targeted tours of areas of specific interest. </p>', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-04-21 02:02:23', 0, '', ''),
(24079, 162, 5, 2, 8, '<p>This strategy is being used by a number of assessment teams</p>', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-04-21 02:02:23', 0, '', ''),
(24080, 162, 6, 2, 1, '<p>Can simplify scheduling if only key team members must join tours of particular areas.  Others can participate based on availability.</p>', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-04-21 02:02:23', 0, '', ''),
(24081, 162, 7, 2, 8, '<p>Come prepared to these meetings with an agenda and an approximate timeline for the meeting. All participants should have questions ready so the meeting can move efficiently.</p>', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-04-21 02:02:23', 0, '', ''),
(24082, 162, 8, 2, 32, '', 'https://www.ocpower.org/wp-content/uploads/Blog-EnergyEfficiencyDay-Main.jpg', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-04-21 02:02:23', 0, '', 'sha384-wjoALjPASV7UtSUpp//jvp4SDRCAZLIKWaVK7fnxETAEcvTdGvulJx4JyEUUxJpw'),
(24083, 157, 0, 0, 26, '<p>Develop a table of significant energy using equipment including collected rated capacity, estimated % of full capacity, and hours of operation</p>', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-04-21 02:02:44', 0, '', ''),
(24084, 157, 1, 1, 12, '<p>Calculate an initial estimate of annual energy used by each piece of equipment</p>', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-04-21 02:02:44', 0, '', ''),
(24085, 157, 2, 1, 12, '<p>Develop a pie chart showing % of total site energy each modeled equipment item uses, and remaining unidentified energy use.</p>', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-04-21 02:02:44', 0, '', ''),
(24086, 157, 3, 2, 14, '<p>Does the total modeled energy exceed the actual energy in the bills? (If so, revise the model.) </p>', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-04-21 02:02:44', 0, '', ''),
(24087, 157, 4, 1, 12, '<p>Plan to continually revise and improve this balance over the process of the remote assessment.</p>', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-04-21 02:02:44', 0, '', ''),
(24088, 157, 5, 2, 14, '<p>Does more equipment come up that can be added?</p>', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-04-21 02:02:44', 0, '', ''),
(24089, 157, 6, 2, 14, '<p>Does better data become available on any modeled equipment to improve its annual energy use estimate?</p>', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-04-21 02:02:44', 0, '', ''),
(24090, 157, 7, 1, 17, '<p>(Item not added yet)</p>', 'osu.edu', 'Example Energy Balance', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-04-21 02:02:44', 0, '', ''),
(24091, 157, 8, 1, 32, '', 'https://www.ocpower.org/wp-content/uploads/Blog-EnergyEfficiencyDay-Main.jpg', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-04-21 02:02:44', 0, '', 'sha384-wjoALjPASV7UtSUpp//jvp4SDRCAZLIKWaVK7fnxETAEcvTdGvulJx4JyEUUxJpw'),
(24092, 156, 0, 0, 31, '<p>This meeting is analogous to the what the OSU IAC has traditionally called the \"Pre-Audit Walkthrough Phone Call\" (excluding site visit logistics, safety and PPE discussion)</p>', '%zXz%', '%zXz%', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-04-21 02:03:29', 0, '', ''),
(24093, 156, 1, 0, 26, '<p>Have the client(s) verbally  \"walk us through\" their process, highlighting key energy intensive processes</p>', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-04-21 02:03:29', 0, '', ''),
(24094, 156, 2, 1, 14, '<p>Ask client(s) to let us know of any areas of concern or interest</p>', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-04-21 02:03:29', 0, '', ''),
(24095, 156, 3, 1, 14, '<p>Ask for rated capacity, estimated % of full capacity, and hours of operation for significant equipment discussed.</p>', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-04-21 02:03:29', 0, '', ''),
(24096, 156, 4, 2, 8, '<p>Estimates of the number of smaller motor of various sizes with average load and hours can also be helpful.</p>', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-04-21 02:03:29', 0, '', ''),
(24097, 156, 5, 1, 14, '<p>Are common utilities such as compressed air, lighting, heating, etc covered in the conversation?</p>', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-04-21 02:03:29', 0, '', ''),
(24098, 156, 6, 0, 26, '<p>Discuss proposed process for remote assessment going forward (we are still learning and developing this process)</p>', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-04-21 02:03:29', 0, '', ''),
(24099, 156, 7, 0, 8, '<p>Try to get more than one key contact at the site involved in the project. (Plant manager, Fiscal Decision Maker, Maintenance Manager, Floor Personnel, Energy Lead, etc)</p>', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-04-21 02:03:29', 0, '', ''),
(24100, 156, 8, 0, 17, '<p>(Item not added yet)</p>', 'abc.com', 'Pre-Audit Walkthrough Phone Call Checklist', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-04-21 02:03:29', 0, '', ''),
(24101, 156, 9, 0, 14, '<p>How best could we get Utility &amp; Incentive Representatives involved (if the client permits) </p>', '', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-04-21 02:03:29', 0, '', ''),
(24102, 156, 10, 0, 26, '<p>At this point, an analyst should be assigned to start the general background. It may take more time to develop the general background while doing a remote assessment so it\'s best to start it early.</p>', '', '', 0, 1, 0, 0, '2026-04-21 02:03:29', 0, '', ''),
(24103, 156, 11, 0, 32, '', 'https://www.ocpower.org/wp-content/uploads/Blog-EnergyEfficiencyDay-Main.jpg', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, '2026-04-21 02:03:29', 0, '', 'sha384-wjoALjPASV7UtSUpp//jvp4SDRCAZLIKWaVK7fnxETAEcvTdGvulJx4JyEUUxJpw');
